{"type": "info", "prompt": "How the Bitcoin halving works and what it did to price after 2012, 2016, 2020 and 2024", "source": {"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@400;600;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#0a0a0c;--card:#16161a;--ink:#ffffff;--muted:#888892;--accent:#f7931a;--sec:#2d2d35}\nhtml,body{margin:0;width:1080px;height:1350px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:'Outfit',system-ui,sans-serif}\nmain{box-sizing:border-box;height:100%;padding:72px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:32px}\n.kicker{font-size:24px;letter-spacing:.15em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\nh1{font-size:92px;line-height:0.95;margin:12px 0 0;letter-spacing:-.03em}\n.hero{background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--card), #202026);border-radius:32px;padding:48px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\n.hero-text{max-width:550px}\n.hero-text h2{font-size:48px;margin:0 0 16px}\n.hero-text p{font-size:28px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}\n.big-num{font-size:110px;font-weight:800;color:var(--accent)}\n.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px;flex:1}\n.card{background:var(--card);border-radius:28px;padding:36px}\n.card h3{margin:0 0 24px;font-size:28px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;color:var(--muted)}\n.row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--sec)}\n.row:last-child{border:none}\n.year{font-weight:800;font-size:32px}\n.val{font-size:32px;color:var(--accent)}\n.chart-container{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;margin-top:10px}\n.bar-wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}\n.label{width:120px;font-size:26px;font-weight:600}\n.track{flex:1;height:24px;background:var(--sec);border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden}\n.fill{height:100%;background:var(--accent);border-radius:12px}\nfooter{font-size:22px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center;margin-top:auto}\n</style></head><body><main>\n<div><div class=\"kicker\">Bitcoin Economics</div><h1>The Halving Cycle</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"hero\">\n    <div class=\"hero-text\">\n        <h2>Supply Shock</h2>\n        <p>Every 210,000 blocks, the reward for mining Bitcoin is cut in half, reducing the new supply entering the market.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"big-num\">50%</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"grid\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3>Price Growth (12mo Post-Halving)</h3>\n        <div class=\"chart-container\">\n            <div class=\"bar-wrap\"><span class=\"label\">2012</span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width:95%\"></div></div><span>~8,000%</span></div>\n            <div class=\"bar-wrap\"><span class=\"label\">2016</span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width:35%\"></div></div><span>~280%</span></div>\n            <div class=\"bar-wrap\"><span class=\"label\">2020</span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width:65%\"></div></div><span>~550%</span></div>\n            <div class=\"bar-wrap\"><span class=\"label\">2024</span><div class=\"track\"><div class=\"fill\" style=\"width:10%\"></div></div><span>TBD</span></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n        <h3>Block Reward History</h3>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"year\">2012</span><span class=\"val\">50 → 25 BTC</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"year\">2016</span><span class=\"val\">25 → 12.5 BTC</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"year\">2020</span><span class=\"val\">12.5 → 6.25 BTC</span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"year\">2024</span><span class=\"val\">6.25 → 3.125 BTC</span></div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<footer>Sources: Blockchain.com, CoinMarketCap historical data (2012-2024)</footer>\n</main></body></html>", "size": [1080, 1350]}, "edits": [], "created": 1792723046.9178061}